{"resourceIdentifier":"4487","resourceName":"Guangxi Baiduoshou Composting Project","description":"Guangxi Baiduoshou Composting Project (hereafter referred to as the project) introduced a set of organic fertilizers production lines with an annual output of 25,050 tons to treat the manure from the chicken farms and Biomass waste residue i.e., straw in Tiandeng county, Chongzuo city, Guangxi Province. The project is invested and owned by Guangxi Baiduoshou Biotechnology Co., Ltd. The purpose of the project activity is to avoid methane emissions through controlled aerobic treatment by composting of manure and biomass waste residue. In absence of the project, all manure waste produced was left to decay in uncovered anaerobic lagoons, which is the most economic, viable and reasonable for livestock farm owners.\r\nThis project was designed to treat the chicken manure and biomass waste residue (straw) to produce organic fertilizer. This project comprises of fermentation system and fertilizer production system. It is estimated that approximately 80,000 tonnes of manure and 10,500 tonnes of biomass waste residue can be treated annually, therefore total 90,500 tonnes of waste can be composted aerobically for this project. the collected chicken manure will be utilized through a fermentation composting process. After the fermentation, both solids and wastewater are then treated by a fertilizer production system, of which can produce organic fertilizers used for application to lands.","location":{"latitude":23.060890,"longitude":107.112891},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-29","endExclusive":"2023-09-29","endInclusive":"2023-09-28"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4487"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Baiduoshou Biotechnology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 15907770555"},{"type":"string","value":"hp-zhang@126.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"57615"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"17/03/2026"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 08/02/2023 - 07/02/2033"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=96160&IDKEY=v8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq00132604640","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"01-Guangxi baiduoshou composting project-PD-clean version(1).pdf","uploadDate":"2023-08-28T07:03:20.16Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=147396&IDKEY=klksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098j203259084","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"PDMR VCS4487 2rd clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2026-03-17T10:12:06.9Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=127082&IDKEY=slksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098h175246078","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"Registration-Representation-VCS4487-v4.4.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-02-07T01:45:30.46Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=147397&ID